              "help": {
                "text": "Parsing a multipart form can bypass memory limits and read an arbitrarily long line into memory when the remaining limit at the start of a part is less than 400 bytes.\n",
                "markdown": "> Parsing a multipart form can bypass memory limits and read an arbitrarily long line into memory when the remaining limit at the start of a part is less than 400 bytes.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.24.6  |\n|Affected range  <1.26.9                   |\n|Fixed version   1.26.9                    |\n"
